        <object id="media-mod-bucket" label="&lt;b&gt;Bucket gooddeeds-media&lt;/b&gt; (private)&lt;br&gt;SeaweedFS in compose (dev); GCS asia-south1 at launch (not configured)" status="partial" milestone="M3" source="docker-compose.yml#storage; backend/app/core/config.py"><mxCell style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="455" width="340" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object>
        <object id="media-mod-core" label="&lt;b&gt;core&lt;/b&gt; runtime_config (load MediaLimits), events (outbox), audit, ratelimit, jobs, db" status="implemented" milestone="M0" source="backend/app/core/runtime_config.py; backend/app/core/events.py; backend/app/core/audit.py; backend/app/core/ratelimit.py; backend/app/core/jobs.py"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="545" width="340" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object>
        <mxCell id="media-mod-rule" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt; (M3-DESIGN §0, §4). Import direction: media.service and private files never import feed; only router.py reads feed.service (D30, tests/test_architecture.py). Blur is applied once on the server; no unblurred copy is kept (D33, Q31). Private bucket + signed GET URLs: signing time floored to 30 min, valid 60 min (D34). Uploader / doer removal deletes the objects after commit; admin removal moves them to held/ so every issued URL returns 404 at once; restore uses a new version. Reports never change a photo, deed, verification, counts or points (D42)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="780" width="1140" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
